# Binary assets must never pass through end-of-line conversion. With
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows, git had been classifying 17 PDFs as text;
# their bytes happened to contain no CR, so nothing was corrupted, but the
# next PDF with a CR byte would have been. Declared explicitly instead of
# relying on content sniffing.
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
